+
+- **The shipped files, with the privacy test.** `node tests/run-all.mjs privacy` opens every page, uses every feature with stand-ins for the outside sites, and compares what was kept and sent with the lists at the top of `tests/privacy.test.mjs`. It passed on the tree this page was written for.
